  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Aid Transparency Initiative (IATI) Membership contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Zealand is an established member of the International Aid Transparency Initiative (IATI). New Zealand&#xa0;makes an untagged membership contribution each year towards IATI&#x2019;s global operating costs. Membership enables New Zealand to share and receive best practice on aid transparency, and receive technical support for&#xa0;IATI data publication. Membership sends an important public signal of New Zealand&apos;s commitment to transparency.</narrative>
  </description>
